sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher
  participant Browser
  participant API as Spring API / access checks
  participant DB as Academic database
  participant Store as Private upload storage
  Teacher->>Browser: Select assigned course
  Browser->>API: GET /api/teacher/courses/{id}/students
  API->>DB: Verify course ownership and load enrolled roster
  DB-->>API: Student profile DTOs, including photo path
  API-->>Browser: Authorized roster
  Browser->>API: GET /api/files/download?filePath=students/{id}_...
  API->>DB: Verify requesting teacher teaches student
  DB-->>API: Ownership decision
  alt Teacher assigned to student
    API->>Store: Read requested image
    Store-->>API: Image bytes
    API-->>Browser: Inline image response
    Teacher->>Browser: Click photo
    Browser-->>Teacher: Full-screen photo viewer
  else Not assigned
    API-->>Browser: Deny access
  end
  Teacher->>Browser: Request roster/grade CSV
  Browser-->>Teacher: Download selected-course dataset only
